  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can channel magic into your spores. As a Magic action, you can expend a use of your Wild Shape to awaken them instead of transforming, and you gain 4 Temporary Hit Points per Druid level. While this feature is active, you gain the following benefits.</p><ul><li>When you deal your Halo of Spores damage, roll the damage die a second time and add it to the total.</li><li>Your melee weapon attacks deal an extra 1d6 Necrotic damage to any target they hit.</li></ul><p>These benefits last for 10 minutes, until you lose all these Temporary Hit Points, or until you use your Wild Shape again.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
